### Phase 4.5: Quality Gate (--no-gate to skip)

After the user confirms the draft, run the {{OUTSIDE_LABEL}} quality gate (default ON).
Purpose: catch ambiguities that survived your interrogation. {{OUTSIDE_LABEL}} (the outside reviewer) reads the spec and scores it 0-10 for "executability by an unfamiliar
